OL,3,CMan charged with attempted rape of two
OL,4,Cwomen
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man has been charged
OL,7,Fwith attempted rape after two women
OL,8,Freported being sexually assaulted in
OL,9,Fparks within 90 minutes of each other.
OL,11,FGreater Manchester Police received two
OL,12,Freports of sexual assault from victims
OL,13,Fon Saturday, 25 July, in Rochdale.
OL,15,FHarvey Symes, 23, described by police
OL,16,Fas a black British national, has been
OL,17,Fcharged with two counts of attempted
OL,18,Frape and making threats to kill.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
