OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785169122
OL,3,CMan charged with attempted rape of two
OL,4,Cwomen
OL,6,FAt 6:15am, officers received a report
OL,7,Fthat a woman had been sexually
OL,8,Fassaulted in Broadfield Park.
OL,10,FA second report was made by a
OL,11,Fdifferent woman who alleged she had
OL,12,Fbeen assaulted in Milnrow Memorial
OL,13,FPark at 8.38am.
OL,15,FSymes, of Milnrow, will appear at
OL,16,FManchester and Salford Magistrates'
OL,17,FCourt on Monday, 27 July.
